"Chambre périphérique profonde : fermeture peu probable, mais la gonioscopie reste l’examen de référence.": "Deep peripheral chamber: closure unlikely, but gonioscopy remains the reference test.",
"Grade ≤ 2 : angle possiblement étroit → **gonioscopie** avant toute dilatation répétée et pour classer (PACS/PAC/PACG).": "Grade ≤ 2: possibly narrow angle → **gonioscopy** before repeated dilation and to classify (PACS/PAC/PACG).",
"<div class=\"simgrid\"><div class=\"fig\" style=\"background:#2b2b2b\"><div class=\"fig-body\"><canvas data-spec width=\"500\" height=\"340\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block\"></canvas></div><div class=\"fig-cap\" style=\"background:var(--surface)\"><span>Champ ≈ 250 × 170 µm de mosaïque endothéliale</span><span class=\"schema-badge\">Simulation pédagogique</span></div></div>": "<div class=\"simgrid\"><div class=\"fig\" style=\"background:#2b2b2b\"><div class=\"fig-body\"><canvas data-spec width=\"500\" height=\"340\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block\"></canvas></div><div class=\"fig-cap\" style=\"background:var(--surface)\"><span>Field ≈ 250 × 170 µm of endothelial mosaic</span><span class=\"schema-badge\">Teaching simulation</span></div></div>",
"Densité (cell/mm²)": "Density (cells/mm²)",
"Variabilité de taille et de forme": "Variation in size and shape",
"<div class=\"grid2\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))\"><div class=\"readout\"><span class=\"u\">Densité</span><span class=\"v\" data-se></span></div><div class=\"readout\"><span class=\"u\">CV</span><span class=\"v\" data-scv></span></div><div class=\"readout\"><span class=\"u\">% hexagonales</span><span class=\"v\" data-shx></span></div></div><p class=\"small\" data-st></p></div></div>": "<div class=\"grid2\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))\"><div class=\"readout\"><span class=\"u\">Density</span><span class=\"v\" data-se></span></div><div class=\"readout\"><span class=\"u\">CV</span><span class=\"v\" data-scv></span></div><div class=\"readout\"><span class=\"u\">% hexagonal</span><span class=\"v\" data-shx></span></div></div><p class=\"small\" data-st></p></div></div>",
"Densité critique : décompensation probable (œdème). Discuter d’une greffe endothéliale.": "Critical density: decompensation likely (oedema). Discuss an endothelial graft.",
"Réserve faible : prudence avant une chirurgie de cataracte (protection endothéliale, discuter d’une chirurgie combinée).": "Low reserve: caution before cataract surgery (endothelial protection, discuss combined surgery).",
"Densité suffisante pour maintenir la déturgescence.": "Density sufficient to maintain deturgescence.",
" CV élevé = **polymégathisme** (stress endothélial : lentilles, diabète, chirurgie).": " High CV = **polymegathism** (endothelial stress: contact lenses, diabetes, surgery).",
" Peu d’hexagones = **pléomorphisme**.": " Few hexagons = **pleomorphism**.",
"<div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"stack\"><label class=\"small\" for=\"va-in\">Acuité (ex. 6/12, 20/40 ou logMAR 0,3)</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"va-in\" value=\"6/12\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"readout\"><span class=\"u\">Équivalences</span><span class=\"small mono\" data-va></span></div></div><div class=\"callout small\" data-vas></div></div>": "<div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"stack\"><label class=\"small\" for=\"va-in\">Acuity (e.g. 6/12, 20/40 or logMAR 0.3)</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"va-in\" value=\"6/12\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"readout\"><span class=\"u\">Equivalents</span><span class=\"small mono\" data-va></span></div></div><div class=\"callout small\" data-vas></div></div>",
"Format non reconnu : écris 6/12, 20/40 ou 0,3.": "Format not recognized: type 6/12, 20/40 or 0.3.",
